      "content": "that's a good start. it's punchy. but i want to lean into the \"failure of character\" part a bit more. like, what's the actual cost to the community when people decide it's \"too much work\" or they just don't care? can you add a section that really calls out the selfishness of just sitting it out while everyone else does the work? make it feel like if you're skipping the ballot, you're basically letting the community down on purpose.",
